OL,3,AFarmer who called 999 saw 'large group
OL,4,Aof hooded and masked men' near RAF
OL,5,AFairford, she tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FA farmer who called 999 when she saw "a
OL,8,Flarge group of hooded and masked men"
OL,9,Fnear RAF Fairford early on Sunday
OL,10,Fmorning has spoken to the BBC
OL,12,FThe farmer tells the Today programme
OL,13,Fshe was coming home late from a party
OL,14,Fwhen a road was blocked by "three white
OL,15,Fvans", which she called "suspicious".
OL,16,FShe then saw the group of men run off
OL,18,FShe says she called 999 at 01:36 BST.
OL,19,F"Within 10 minutes the village was full
OL,20,Fof armed police. I think it was pure
OL,21,Fluck that I arrived in the village at a
OL,22,Fsimilar time to the vans"
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
