OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFarmer who called 999 saw 'large group
OL,4,Aof hooded and masked men' near RAF
OL,5,AFairford, she tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe farmer says the authorities
OL,8,F"dropped the ball" - although Defence
OL,9,FSecretary Wes Streeting says she only
OL,10,Fhas a "partial picture". He also
OL,11,Frefuses to speculate on possible
OL,12,FIranian links to the suspects, saying
OL,13,Fhe is not "drawing a connection with
OL,14,FIran"
OL,16,FGloucestershire Police say they were
OL,17,Falerted at about 00:45 BST on Sunday.
OL,18,FFive men remain in custody - they were
OL,19,Farrested under the Explosives Act, and
OL,20,Fon suspicion of preparing a terrorist
OL,21,Fact
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
